From 8edd602b8c5a985e37d9bd8dfb0c998842fbb9cb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 21:35:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Trader limits, Elite Four rewards, exhibition message,
 post-game audit (R19)

- Treasure trader: one Master Ball per Trainer Tower clear, and 3 PP Ups
  trade for a PP Max.
- Each peak Elite Four member gives the Gym Leader rematch reward.
- Nuzlocke: blacking out in an exhibition battle says the run goes on.
- Trainer Tower: trainers whose family ran out (e.g. three Goldeen) get
  another fully evolved Pokemon of the same type instead of a base form or
  a repeat (tower_sets.py, re-run on the original data).
- validate.py audits peak teams and Trainer Tower teams.
- Playtest: 25 checks.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01JQmLEZftLdDmGYX3wiQ71G
